class Baz implements Bar {}

type Foo = Bar;

type Foo = Bar & Baz;
```

Examples of **correct** code for the `{ "allowAliases": "in-unions" }` option:

```ts option='{ "allowAliases": "in-unions" }' showPlaygroundButton
